adding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px\" target=\"_blank\"><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\"mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style=\"max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px\">Update my preferences</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style=\"mso-font-width:400%\" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></p><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 16px;color:#426591;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0\">If the button doesn&#x27;t work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<!-- --> <a href=\"{{magicLinkUrl}}\" style=\"color:#1d3d63;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\">{{magicLinkUrl}}</a></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0\">If you didn&#x27;t request this, you can safely ignore this email — nothing will change.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" class=\"content\" style=\"padding:0 40px 40px;text-align:center\"><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#426591;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0\">This email was sent to <!-- -->{{email}}<!-- --> because someone requested a link to update the notification preferences for this address.</p><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#426591;text-align:center;margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-left:0\">Our World in Data · Global Change Data Lab · Oxford, United Kingdom</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><div><!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></div></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
    "text": "{{siteBaseUrl}}\n\n\nUPDATE YOUR PREFERENCES\n\nClick the button below to view and update your Our World in Data email notification preferences. The link is valid for 30 minutes.\n\nUpdate my preferences {{magicLinkUrl}}\n\nIf the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser: {{magicLinkUrl}}\n\nIf you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email — nothing will change.\n\nThis email was sent to {{email}} because someone requested a link to update the notification preferences for this address.\n\nOur World in Data · Global Change Data Lab · Oxford, United Kingdom\n\n"
